<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The full evaluation results, including all metrics (nDCG@1, nDCG@5, nDCG@10, R@1, R@5, R@10) are shown in Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Zeroshot VDR Results ‣ SERVAL: Surprisingly Effective Zero-Shot Visual Document Retrieval Powered by Large Vision and Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> respectively.</p>
</div>
